<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius exports 42,83O tonnes of sugar in Feb.</title>
<headline>Mauritius exports 42,83O tonnes of sugar in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritius Sugar Syndicate (MSS) exported 42,830 tonnes of sugar in February compared to 34,927 tonnes in January and 20,979 tonnes in February 1996, the Public Relations Office of the Sugar Industry (PROSI) magazine reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Of the total export figure, 42,046 tonnes was exported to European Union (EU) countries and 315 tonnes to the United States. The remaining 469 tonnes went to the world market.</p>
<p>--Clifford Vellien ++230 211-9555.</p>
</text>
